  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_csb3",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -300
      },
      "text": "ECUMASTER CSB3 HARNESS - the CSB3 plug (HD36-24-33SE) and its switch inputs: cruise stalk, clutch and brake switches, the cruise ladder pull-up. Its +12V, ground and +5V wires come in broken off from ST185-A-cabin; the reverse input from ST185-B-cabin, the oil LED sink from ST185-ClusterLED and CAN H/L from ST185-CAN all arrive broken off with a note. Non-ECU harness."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_cavity_notes",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 4200,
        "y": 0
      },
      "text": "CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nECUMaster CSB3 - Power/CAN/Swi c26: L4 low-side - oil pressure LED sink (CAN 0x643); the wire from this pin to the LED is drawn on ST185-ClusterLED (broken off)\ncsb3io (label): ECUMaster CSB3 (power feed — full I/O on ST185-CSB3)"
    }
  ],
